== Effects ==
* Upon use, sacrifices up to two [[familiar]]s and spawns an item pedestal for each familiar sacrificed.
** The order in which the familiars were obtained does not matter; it picks 2 at random to sacrifice.
* Any [[Blue Fly|Blue Flies]], [[Blue Spider]]s, [[Locust]]s, [[Sumptorium|Clots]], [[Familiar#Dips|Dips]], or [[Giant Cell|Minisaacs]] will be converted to 1 {{e|Penny}} each.
* [[Familiar#Wisps|Wisps]] will be turned into {{e|Half Red Heart}}s each, and [[Lemegeton|Item Wisps]] will be turned into {{e|Half Soul Heart}}s.
